From ae8b0606b88c0c7b5d924150c699cf792648086e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <tetcu@fgorg.vn>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:52:40 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 09/11] feat(decisions): decision panel on the issue page

Open decisions show above the approval panel: the question, the options with
the recommended one marked and preselected, an optional note, and Answer.
Answering records the choice and posts it as a comment so the issue's agent
wakes up. Core: @multica/core/decisions and client methods.

Patch-Id: decisions-ui
